## Update Timing Requirements
Core Update Categories:
1. Real-time (60fps): Animations, movement, visual effects
   - Use requestAnimationFrame for smooth updates
   - Implement RAF fallback for background tabs
   - Required for smooth visual feedback

2. Speed-based: Attack animations (per battalion speed stat)
   - Duration = 1000ms / speed stat
   - Use Animated.timing with proper easing
   - Critical for consistent combat pacing

3. Global timer (1s): Health, damage, state synchronization
   - Align with backend update cycle
   - Buffer state changes for smooth transitions
   - Ensures consistent game state

## Performance Optimization
State Categories:
1. Battle State:
   - Phase tracking optimization
   - Timer management efficiency
   - Victory condition calculations
   - Node ownership updates

2. Battalion State:
   - Position tracking optimization
   - Health/status updates
   - Target information caching
   - Movement path calculations

3. Combat State:
   - Attack calculation optimization
   - Damage resolution efficiency
   - Range checking algorithms
   - Collision detection performance

Remember: All performance optimizations must maintain system integrity and not compromise core mechanics. 